title: 'PluginHost: conversation-end hook so trace plugins can close a root span'
updated: 2026-11-08T04:36:02Z
---

Plugin.pm has no end-of-conversation hook outside Raider (plugin_after_raid). Plugin::OTel (k403) therefore emits no synthetic root span: chat spans are top-level in the conversation trace, execute_tool spans are children of the chat span that requested them. A plugin_after_conversation (or similar) hook on Chat/tool loop would let OTel emit an exact root span. Decide whether worth it.
